    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "meaning? i don't think there's anything left to find. it's just caretaking, cleaning up messes, and watching him disappear bit by bit. and i'm disappearing too. it feels like my whole life has just been put on hold indefinitely. i feel like a ghost walking through my own house. sometimes i look at him and i just think... eventually, we're both just gonna be gone, and it would be so much quieter then.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
