    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "nothing helps. i've tried everything. talking, resting, trying to find \"meaning\"... it all just feels so empty. it's like the world keeps moving but i'm just stuck in this waiting room. it feels less like i'm living a life and more like i'm just waiting for the end of a shift that never finishes. honestly, i just find myself thinking about how peaceful it would be when it's all just over. when we can both finally just rest.",
